# Real-Chrome fullscreen regression harness (verify.mjs / make-mutant.sh /
# debug.mjs / real-site.mjs) plus its outputs: per-scenario screenshots,
# results.json, temporary Chrome profiles, and mutant/ — a complete copy of the
# extension with the top-layer fix deliberately disabled as a negative control.
# Kept local on purpose: mutant/ is loadable and still contains the bug, so
# selecting it in chrome://extensions by mistake would run the broken code, and
# loading it alongside the real extension makes the two content scripts delete
# each other's subtitle layer. The scripts regenerate everything.
.verify/
